      "updated": 1782452997981,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal: Ai-drive, and natural-languge producing draw.\n\nMethods:\n- Programming language for 3d printner.\n- From PNG to STL and beyond.\n- LLMs\n\nResults:\n- A semi-reproducible,h details-oriainted, and adjustable outcome.\n- Consumes <100k tokens\n\n",
      "fontSize": 67.57901785714314,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Goal: Ai-drive, and natural-languge producing draw.\n\nMethods:\n- Programming language for 3d printner.\n- From PNG to STL and beyond.\n- LLMs\n\nResults:\n- A semi-reproducible,h details-oriainted, and adjustable outcome.\n- Consumes <100k tokens\n\n",
